JV CLI
Independent launcher and JV API compatibility adapter.

The locally installed agent engine is the open-source OpenAI Codex project.
Original upstream license and NOTICE files are retained in third_party/openai-codex/.
This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by OpenAI.

JV CLI 0.3.0 changes the launcher, adapter, installation scripts,
tests and documentation from the previous JV CLI 0.2.3 package.
It does not contain a modified or recompiled Codex Rust source tree.
